ll,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"11cnihd","at":1788056747180},"key":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/程序设计与构建流程.md##调试与测试#{1}","lines":[72,85],"size":455,"should_embed":true,"embedding":{"history":[],"default":{"mf_ccarbz":{"file":"mf_ccarbz","file_i":1770,"read_hash":"11cnihd","at":1788056831311}}}}},"block_embedding_selection":{"version":2,"min_chars":200,"max_input_chars":1894,"source_key":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/程序设计与构建流程.md","requires_reimport":false},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[39,44]],"outlinks_version":2},
"smart_sources:计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/模板与容器.md": {"class_name":"SmartSource","last_read":{"hash":"1i6gq4j","at":1788056747180},"embedding":{"history":[],"default":{"mf_ccarbz":{"file":"mf_ccarbz","file_i":305,"read_hash":"1i6gq4j","at":1788056832558}}},"path":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/模板与容器.md","last_import":{"mtime":1787144143334,"size":4399,"at":1788056747282,"hash":"1i6gq4j"},"outlinks":[{"title":"first, last)` 表示从 `first` 开始、到 `last` 之前结束的元素序列。\r\n\r\n半开区间具有三项便利：\r\n\r\n+ 空区间满足 `first == last`。\r\n+ 元素数可表示为距离 `last - first`，若迭代器支持随机访问。\r\n+ 相邻区间可自然拼接而不重复边界。\r\n\r\n不同容器和修改操作具有不同的迭代器失效规则。例如 `vector` 扩容会使指向其元素的指针、引用和迭代器失效。\r\n\r\n## 算法与函数对象\r\n\r\n`<algorithm>` 中的算法通过迭代器工作，与具体容器解耦。排序、查找、变换和累计等操作应优先复用标准算法。\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nstd::sort(values.begin(), values.end());\r\nauto found = std::find(values.begin(), values.end(), target);\r\n```\r\n\r\nlambda 表达式可作为比较器或回调：\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nstd::sort(records.begin(), records.end(),\r\n          [","target":"const Record& left, const Record& right","line":65},{"title":"多态与虚函数","target":"多态与虚函数","line":111}],"blocks_data":{"##泛型程序设计":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"5ku0q9","at":1788056747180},"key":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/模板与容器.md##泛型程序设计","lines":[1,6],"size":142,"should_embed":false},"##泛型程序设计#{1}":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1sjwf0o","at":1788056747180},"key":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/模板与容器.md##泛型程序设计#{1}","lines":[3,6],"size":129,"should_embed":false},"##函数模板":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"i48h49","at":1788056747180},"key":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/模板与容器.md##函数模板","lines":[7,21],"size":288,"should_embed":false},"##函数模板#{1}":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1mhepc5","at":1788056747180},"key":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设计基础/模板与容器.md##函数模板#{1}","lines":[9,21],"size":277,"should_embed":true,"embedding":{"history":[],"default":{"mf_ccarbz":{"file":"mf_ccarbz","file_i":1751,"read_hash":"1mhepc5","at":1788056830639}}}},"##类模板":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1fc5q5i","at":1788056747180},"key":"计算/CP - 计算机程序设